{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very challenging, run\u2011based precision brick\u2011breaker. If you\u2019re looking for casual, this isn\u2019t it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or up to three player local co\u2011op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no checkpoints, no retries, and no safety nets \u2014 just your skill, your ammo, and your ability to manage resources as the levels get harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break bricks to harvest Alchemite, the game's currency. Spend it between levels to buy ammo, extra balls and lives, or trade strategically as prices shift with supply and demand. Every shot matters, every purchase matters, and every mistake ends the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy fixed levels, tight arcade loops, and resource pressure, then welcome to PowBall Renaissance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654600/extras/1fb2d83de4055f9d4d41a7ba67c934cc.webp?t=1767023982\" width=265 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e 330+ handcrafted levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Play solo or up to 3 player shared screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e The usual power-ups, plus: portals, helper bots, sub-games &amp; more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Play using touch-screen, mouse, keyboard, or any game controller</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Harvest Alchemite to spend on ammo, balls and lives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Permadeath: no saving, no loading, just pure skill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Built-in level editor (mouse + keyboard required)</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pacifist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/654600/eaf0bb8f7268cc02eb72ad32bcd3d48f7754b41a.jpg"},{"name":"War Hawk","path":"